{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09620","headline":"观楚国寺璋上人写一切经院南有曲池深竹 · 岑参","name":"观楚国寺璋上人写一切经院南有曲池深竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"璋公不出院，羣木闭深居。\n誓写一切经，欲向万卷余。\n挥毫散林鹊，研墨警池鱼。\n音翻四句偈，字译五天书。\n鸣钟竹阴晚，汲水桐花初。\n雨气润衣鉢，香烟泛庭除。\n此地日清净，诸天应未如。\n不知将锡杖，早晚蹑空虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}